| docker service create --name frontend --replicas 1 --publish 1111:80 killadi98/statichtml-practice:v1 | image should be from the dockerhub not the local images| because if the image is present in the local server all the containers will be created in that specific server and defeats the purpose of a cluster |

| docker node ls |

| docker service ls |

| docker service ps frontend |

# the app can be accessed from all the manager and worker nodes ( but the ports 7946, 4789 and 2377 should be allowed in the security groups )

| docker service scale frontend=3 | to scale the replicas to 3 |

| docker service rm frontend |

| docker service update frontend --image=shaikmustafa/paytm:movie | to update any changes like the image |

| docker service rollback frontend | to rollback to the previous version | we cannot rollback to a specific version |

| docker service inspect frontend |

| docker node rm worker | to remove the node from the cluster | but only after the status changes to down by going to the worker and leaving the swarm from the worker node | docker swarm leave |

| docker swarm join-token worker | token for a node to join as a worker |

| docker swarm join-token manager | token for a node to join as a manager | we can have multiple manager servers |



